#: sm-products.php
msgid "SM Products"
msgstr "SM Products"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: sm-products.php
msgid "https://github.com/fdebbi/steel-marketplace"
msgstr "https://github.com/fdebbi/steel-marketplace"

#. Description of the plugin
#: sm-products.php
msgid ""
"New steel products market: publication by category with category-specific "
"fields (profiles from the European catalogue, tubes, plates, bars, roofing, "
"finishing parts), weights from SM Weight Engine, photos and technical "
"sheets, moderation, public listings and seller dashboard. Requires SM Core "
"and SM Weight Engine."
msgstr ""
"Marché des produits acier neufs : publication par catégorie avec des champs "
"propres à chaque catégorie (profilés du catalogue européen, tubes, tôles, "
"barres, toiture, pièces de finition), poids calculés par SM Weight Engine, "
"photos et fiches techniques, modération, annonces publiques et tableau de "
"bord vendeur. Nécessite SM Core et SM Weight Engine."

#. Author of the plugin
#: sm-products.php
msgid "Steel Marketplace"
msgstr "Steel Marketplace"

